# Node.js Project

Minimal README for a Node.js project.

## Description
A simple Node.js project template. Replace sections below with project-specific details.

## Prerequisites
- Node.js v14+ (or as required)
- npm or yarn

## Installation
1. Clone the repo:
    git clone <repo-url>
2. Install dependencies:
    npm install
    # or
    yarn install

## Usage
Start the app:
npm start
# or
yarn start

Run tests:
npm test
# or
yarn test

## Scripts
- start — run the application
- test — run test suite
- build — build artifacts (if applicable)
- lint — run linters

